  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;MATTY BLAIR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Matty Blair is a local football star who has recently signed with Racing Club Warwick F.C., bringing experience and skill to the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RACING CLUB WARWICK F.C.&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Racing Club Warwick F.C. is a football club based in Warwick, England, that has signed Matty Blair to bolster its squad."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WARWICK, ENGLAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Warwick, England is the location of Racing Club Warwick F.C., where Matty Blair will play."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOHN SMITH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"John Smith is the Chairman of Racing Club Warwick F.C., who expressed excitement about Matty Blair joining the team."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSFERMARKT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transfermarkt is a reputable football statistics website that confirms Matty Blair's move to Racing Club Warwick F.C."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FOOTBALL ASSOCIATION (FA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Football Association (FA) confirmed Blair's registration transfer to Racing Club Warwick F.C."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CSKA POMIR DUSHANBE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"CSKA Pomir Dushanbe is a football club based in Dushanbe, Tajikistan, where Matty Blair later plays."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TAJIKISTAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tajikistan is the country where CSKA Pomir Dushanbe is located, and where Matty Blair plays later."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AZIZ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Aziz is a towering center-back for CSKA Pomir Dushanbe, known for his dramatic headers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JAVLON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Javlon is a speedy winger for CSKA Pomir Dushanbe, with a mischievous glint in his eye."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUSTAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rustam is a grizzled goalkeeper for CSKA Pomir Dushanbe, with a wealth of experience."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIKTOR&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Viktor is the coach of CSKA Pomir Dushanbe, known for his dedication to the club and its players."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;THE PATRON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Patron is a mysterious figure who owns the team and is rumored to have significant influence over the team's operations, often acting from behind the scenes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Patron is the mysterious owner of CSKA Pomir Dushanbe, rumored to have significant influence over the club."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DUSHANBE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Dushanbe is the city where CSKA Pomir Dushanbe is based and where Matty Blair plays."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;STADIUM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The CSKA Pomir Dushanbe stadium is a humble affair, a crumbling concrete bowl with a faded scoreboard and a patchy grass pitch."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRAINING SESSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Training sessions are part of the daily routine for the CSKA Pomir Dushanbe team, where players go through their paces."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TEAM BUS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The team bus is used by the CSKA Pomir Dushanbe team to travel to matches and training sessions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rolling hills are mentioned as a place where Matty Blair has played before, contrasting with the setting in Dushanbe."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0060</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BUSTLING STREETS&quot;">
